[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://bwuv2iieuq10f"]

; THE OLD SUITE'S FIXTURE, and nothing else. Not a scene anybody plays.
;
; `tests/moveset_smoke_test.gd` instantiates this, and it used to instantiate
; `scenes/main.tscn` — which quietly made the project's ENTRY SCENE also the
; test fixture for the deprecated controller. So `main.tscn` could not be
; rebuilt for the modal moveset without deleting 214 checks on the way past,
; and the two had no business being the same file.
;
; It is deliberately a snapshot: `test_level.tscn` + `player.tscn` + the HUD,
; exactly as `main.tscn` was before the rebuild. It pairs the DEPRECATED
; controller with the level built for the DEPRECATED moveset, which is the only
; combination those checks were ever written against. Both halves retire
; together, when Stage B5 rewrites the suite.
;
; One thing was dropped on the way across: a `swing_max_rope = 6.5` override.
; That is a GRAPPLE property, and the grapple was deleted from `player.gd` long
; ago — so the line had been silently ignored for weeks. A property written
; into a `.tscn` that the script does not have produces no warning whatsoever;
; see "Things that will bite you" in CLAUDE.md.

[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://dlctxiqwl8dhd" path="res://scripts/game.gd" id="1"]
